// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  QUEST BOARD — Phase 7: Mascot / Narrator (Improvement Plan §6, §12 item 7)
//
//  Builds on the Phase 4 mascot dock (placeholder orb) and the Phase 3
//  stage backbone (stageIdx). This section is pure data/logic — the actual
