//   1. mail-engine.js   (data layer: mailGetForStudent, mailIsRead, etc.)
//   2. student-inbox.js (renderStudentMail, mailOpenDetail, mailDoClaimRewards)
//   3. admin-compose.js (renderAdminMail, mailAdminOpenCompose, etc.)
